window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-036-0ea5460c55e626de.json"]={sha256:"0ea5460c55e626de9140abc561381867f058255fc8e7304f8cae754ff91644db",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-dae958d58b59b34a","url":"https://www.ionq.com/resources/reconfigurable-multicore-quantum-architecture","title":"Reconfigurable Multicore Quantum Architecture","titleEn":"Reconfigurable Multicore Quantum Architecture","publisher":"IonQ","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-036","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-036","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-037","referenceUrls":["https://www.ionq.com/resources/best-practices-for-using-ionq-hardware"],"title":"IonQ 螢光讀出：光子計數與可分辨度","titleEn":"IonQ fluorescence readout: photon counting and separation","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付光斑截面、強度／場幅區分及失焦診斷。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver beam sections, intensity/field-amplitude distinctions and defocus diagnosis. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『IonQ 螢光讀出：光子計數與可分辨度』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付計數分布、SNR換算及曝光／狀態穩定性取捨。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'IonQ fluorescence readout: photon counting and separation', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver count distributions, SNR calculations and exposure/state-stability tradeoffs.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：Gaussian強度比I(d)/I0=exp(−2d²/w²)，w是1/e²強度半徑；Rabi頻率比為其平方根。 使用教學離子間距d=4 μm、光束w=2 μm；只計單束幾何尾端。 以手算或試算表計算名義式exp(-2*4**2/2**2)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：檢查d=0比值1；以ln(I/I0)對d²斜率−2/w²重估腰寬。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：獨立Poisson計數的差分SNR=(Nb−Nd)/sqrt(Nb+Nd)；這不是最佳閾值的精確錯誤概率。 使用教學亮態Nb=25、暗態Nd=1個計數；相同曝光時間。 以手算或試算表計算名義式(25-1)/sqrt(25+1)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：分別列Poisson方差等於均值；若觀測方差大於均值，加入光源波動模型。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Gaussian intensity ratio I(d)/I0=exp(−2d²/w²), where w is1/e² intensity radius; Rabi-frequency ratio is its square root. Use Teaching ion spacing d=4 μm and beam w=2 μm; consider only the geometric tail of one beam. Evaluate nominal expression exp(-2*4**2/2**2) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check ratio1 at d=0; recover waist from slope−2/w² of ln(I/I0) versus d².","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: For independent Poisson counts, difference SNR=(Nb−Nd)/sqrt(Nb+Nd); this is not the exact optimal-threshold error probability. Use Teaching bright count Nb=25 and dark count Nd=1 at equal exposure. Evaluate nominal expression (25-1)/sqrt(25+1) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: List Poisson variance equal to mean; if observed variance exceeds mean, add illumination-fluctuation modeling.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-046","referenceUrls":["https://atom-computing.com/quantum-computing-technology/"],"title":"Atom Computing 中性原子：真空壽命與陣列存活","titleEn":"Atom Computing neutral atoms: vacuum lifetime and array survival","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付光斑截面、強度／場幅區分及失焦診斷。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver beam sections, intensity/field-amplitude distinctions and defocus diagnosis. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『Atom Computing 中性原子：真空壽命與陣列存活』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付單顆／陣列存活、簇集診斷及流失後恢復狀態表。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Atom Computing neutral atoms: vacuum lifetime and array survival', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver single/array survival, clustering diagnostics and post-loss recovery states.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：Gaussian強度比I(d)/I0=exp(−2d²/w²)，w是1/e²強度半徑；Rabi頻率比為其平方根。 使用教學離子間距d=4 μm、光束w=2 μm；只計單束幾何尾端。 以手算或試算表計算名義式exp(-2*4**2/2**2)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：檢查d=0比值1；以ln(I/I0)對d²斜率−2/w²重估腰寬。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：若每原子獨立指數壽命τ，N顆在t內全部存活P=exp(−Nt/τ)；共同背景事件會破壞獨立性。 使用教學N=100、τ=100 s、電路窗t=0.1 s；τ為假想有效壽命。 以手算或試算表計算名義式exp(-100*0.1/100)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：先算單顆exp(−t/τ)再取100次方；兩路徑必須一致。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Gaussian intensity ratio I(d)/I0=exp(−2d²/w²), where w is1/e² intensity radius; Rabi-frequency ratio is its square root. Use Teaching ion spacing d=4 μm and beam w=2 μm; consider only the geometric tail of one beam. Evaluate nominal expression exp(-2*4**2/2**2) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check ratio1 at d=0; recover waist from slope−2/w² of ln(I/I0) versus d².","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: For independent exponential lifetime τ per atom, all N survive time t with P=exp(−Nt/τ); common background events violate independence. Use Teaching N=100, τ=100 s and circuit window t=0.1 s; τ is a hypothetical effective lifetime. Evaluate nominal expression exp(-100*0.1/100) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Compute single-atom exp(−t/τ) then raise to100; both routes must agree.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-be4f718fe09216f8","url":"https://www.ionq.com/resources/best-practices-for-using-ionq-hardware","title":"Best Practices for Using IonQ Hardware","titleEn":"Best Practices for Using IonQ Hardware","publisher":"IonQ","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-9e8cba3a789ff3a4","url":"https://atom-computing.com/quantum-computing-technology/","title":"Quantum Computing Technology","titleEn":"Quantum Computing Technology","publisher":"Atom Computing","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
